--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
"""create SSH key""" SSH is 一种“加密的、免密码的远程连接方式”, 用来安全地控制另一台电脑 / 服务器 / GitHub.
#####check if you have SSH key or not
code:
ls ~/.ssh
""""you should see id_XXXXX if you already had key.if not you should create key for you."""

#create SSH key
code:
ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C "your github register email"
press "enter" until you see your green user name or "+----[SHA256]-----+", something like that.

#copy public key not private key. do not ever share private key with others.
code:
cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#add ssh key to your github---------------connect git bash to your github account.
open github -> click your user Profile on your portal right upper -> click "setting" first icon on third block of menu bar. -> click "SSH and GPG keys" on fifth icon of second menu bar on your left hand. ->
click green icon "New SSH key" -> your title name (whatever decided by yourself) -> copy the content return from code "cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub". -> click "Add SSH key"
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#test whether you have connected sucessfully
code:
ssh -T git@github.com

if this is your first time to connect, system will ask you "Are you sure you want to continue connecting?". you must say "yes". and then you will see "Hi xxx! You've successfully authenticated, 
but GitHub does not provide shell access." . now you sucessfully connect git bash to github.
